  "id": "web-dev-065",
  "title": "HTML caption Tag - GeeksforGeeks",
  "content": "<div class=\"html-chunk\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The &lt;caption&gt; tag in HTML is used to provide a title or description for a &lt;table&gt; element. It helps give context or additional information about the content of the table.</span></p><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>The &lt;caption&gt; tag must be placed immediately after the opening &lt;table&gt; tag.</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>Useful for summarizing table data, especially in large datasets</span></li></ul><gfg-tabs data-mode=\"light\" data-run-ide=\"true\">\n            <gfg-tab slot=\"tab\">html</gfg-tab>\n<gfg-panel slot=\"panel\" data-code-lang=\"html\" data-main-code-start=\"None\" data-main-code-end=\"None\">\n    <code class=\"language-html\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"cp\">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">html</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">body</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">table</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">caption</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>Student Information<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">caption</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">tr</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n            <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">th</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>Roll No.<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">th</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n            <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">th</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>Name<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">th</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n            <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">th</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>Age<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">th</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">tr</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">tr</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n            <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>1<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n            <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>Alex<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n            <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>20<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">tr</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">tr</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n            <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>2<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n            <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>Ben<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n            <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>22<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">tr</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">table</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">body</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">html</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n</pre></div></code>\n</gfg-panel></gfg-tabs><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>The &lt;caption&gt; tag provides a title for the table, which in this case is \"Student Information\".</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>The table contains rows of data with roll no, names, and ages.</span></li></ul><h3 id=\"syntax\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span>Syntax</span></h3><pre><span>&lt;caption&gt; . . . . &lt;/caption&gt;</span></pre><blockquote><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Note: </strong></b><span>The&nbsp;</span><code><span>&lt;caption&gt;</span></code><span>&nbsp;tag also supports the&nbsp;</span><a href=\"#/article/web-dev/web-dev-103\"><span>Global Attributes</span></a><span> and </span><a href=\"#/article/web-dev/web-dev-104\"><span>Event Attributes</span></a><span> in HTML.</span></p></blockquote><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Example 1: </strong></b><span>Implementation of an Employee table with a caption tag.</span></p><gfg-tabs data-mode=\"light\" data-run-ide=\"true\">\n            <gfg-tab slot=\"tab\">html</gfg-tab>\n<gfg-panel slot=\"panel\" data-code-lang=\"html\" data-main-code-start=\"None\" data-main-code-end=\"None\">\n    <code class=\"language-html\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"cp\">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">html</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">body</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">table</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">caption</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>Employee Details<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">caption</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">tr</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n            <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">th</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>Employee Name<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">th</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n            <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">th</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>Position<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">th</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">tr</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">tr</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n            <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>John<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n            <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>Manager<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">tr</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">tr</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n            <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>Emma<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n            <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>Developer<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">tr</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">table</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">body</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">html</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n</pre></div></code>\n</gfg-panel></gfg-tabs><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>The </span><code><span>&lt;caption&gt;</span></code><span> tag provides a title for the employee details table.</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>It helps to clarify the purpose of the table for screen readers and users.</span></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Example 2:</strong></b><span> We see a styled Product table with a caption tag.</span></p><gfg-tabs data-mode=\"light\" data-run-ide=\"true\">\n            <gfg-tab slot=\"tab\">HTML</gfg-tab>\n<gfg-panel slot=\"panel\" data-code-lang=\"html\" data-main-code-start=\"None\" data-main-code-end=\"None\">\n    <code class=\"language-html\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"cp\">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">html</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">head</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n\t<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">style</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">\t\t</span><span class=\"nt\">table</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">\t\t\t</span><span class=\"k\">width</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"kt\">%</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">\t\t\t</span><span class=\"k\">border-collapse</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">collapse</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">\t\t</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">\t\t</span><span class=\"nt\">th</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">\t\t</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">\t\t\t</span><span class=\"k\">border</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"kt\">px</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">solid</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">black</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">\t\t\t</span><span class=\"k\">padding</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"kt\">px</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">\t\t</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">\t\t</span><span class=\"nt\">caption</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">\t\t\t</span><span class=\"k\">font-size</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">1.5</span><span class=\"kt\">em</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">\t\t\t</span><span class=\"k\">margin-bottom</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"kt\">px</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">\t\t</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">\t</span><span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">style</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">head</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">body</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n\t<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">table</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">caption</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>Product Details<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">caption</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">tr</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">th</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>Product Name<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">th</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">th</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>Price<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">th</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">tr</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">tr</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>Smartphone<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>$599<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">tr</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">tr</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>Laptop<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>$999<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">td</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">tr</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n\t<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">table</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">body</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">html</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n</pre></div></code>\n</gfg-panel></gfg-tabs><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>The &lt;caption&gt; tag is used to label the table as Product Details, making the content easily identifiable.</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>Custom styles such as border and padding are applied to enhance readability and table structure.</span></li></ul><h2 id=\"best-practices-for-the-html-caption-tag\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span>Best Practices</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Follow structured practices to improve table clarity, accessibility, and maintainability. </span></p><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>Use &lt;caption&gt; to provide a clear and accessible table title.</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>Place &lt;caption&gt; immediately after the opening &lt;table&gt; tag.</span></li><li value=\"3\"><span>Keep captions short, descriptive, and relevant to the table content.</span></li><li value=\"4\"><span>Use </span><code><span>&lt;th&gt;</span></code><span> elements to properly define headers for better structure. </span></li><li value=\"5\"><span>Maintain consistent formatting and alignment across table content. </span></li><li value=\"6\"><span>Avoid overly complex tables; keep layout simple and readable.</span></li></ul></div>",
  "textContent": "The <caption> tag in HTML is used to provide a title or description for a <table> element. It helps give context or additional information about the content of the table.The <caption> tag must be placed immediately after the opening <table> tag.Useful for summarizing table data, especially in large datasets\n            html\n\n    <!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<body>\n    <table>\n        <caption>Student Information</caption>\n        <tr>\n            <th>Roll No.</th>\n            <th>Name</th>\n            <th>Age</th>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>1</td>\n            <td>Alex</td>\n            <td>20</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>2</td>\n            <td>Ben</td>\n            <td>22</td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n</body>\n</html>\n\nThe <caption> tag provides a title for the table, which in this case is \"Student Information\".The table contains rows of data with roll no, names, and ages.Syntax<caption> . . . . </caption>Note: The <caption> tag also supports the Global Attributes and Event Attributes in HTML.Example 1: Implementation of an Employee table with a caption tag.\n            html\n\n    <!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<body>\n    <table>\n        <caption>Employee Details</caption>\n        <tr>\n            <th>Employee Name</th>\n            <th>Position</th>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>John</td>\n            <td>Manager</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Emma</td>\n            <td>Developer</td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n</body>\n</html>\n\nThe <caption> tag provides a title for the employee details table.It helps to clarify the purpose of the table for screen readers and users.Example 2: We see a styled Product table with a caption tag.\n            HTML\n\n    <!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n\t<style>\n\t\ttable {\n\t\t\twidth: 100%;\n\t\t\tborder-collapse: collapse;\n\t\t}\n\t\tth,\n\t\ttd {\n\t\t\tborder: 1px solid black;\n\t\t\tpadding: 10px;\n\t\t}\n\t\tcaption {\n\t\t\tfont-size: 1.5em;\n\t\t\tmargin-bottom: 10px;\n\t\t}\n\t</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\t<table>\n\t\t<caption>Product Details</caption>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<th>Product Name</th>\n\t\t\t<th>Price</th>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>Smartphone</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$599</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>Laptop</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$999</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</table>\n</body>\n</html>\n\nThe <caption> tag is used to label the table as Product Details, making the content easily identifiable.Custom styles such as border and padding are applied to enhance readability and table structure.Best PracticesFollow structured practices to improve table clarity, accessibility, and maintainability. Use <caption> to provide a clear and accessible table title.Place <caption> immediately after the opening <table> tag.Keep captions short, descriptive, and relevant to the table content.Use <th> elements to properly define headers for better structure. Maintain consistent formatting and alignment across table content. Avoid overly complex tables; keep layout simple and readable.",
  "url": "https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/html/html-caption-tag"
}
